-Nothing yet.
+### `check` with no path reads `.smysl/store`
+
+Every bare command reads stdin by rule P, and `check` did too - so a scheduled or pre-commit
+`smysl check` with nothing piped into it either hung on a terminal or silently checked nothing.
+Stdin has no meaning for that use, so `check` alone now falls back to `.smysl/store`, the
+project's default store on disk, resolved against the current directory the same way `ingest`
+resolves `.smysl/staged.smy`. `-` and an explicit `--store` are unchanged.
 
